{
  "segments": [
    {
      "text": "totalVI 的输入是 RNA 和蛋白质的 UMI 计数矩阵，批次协变量是可选的，用于整合数据集。",
      "basis": "CAUTION_CONTEXT",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "quote": "The input to totalVI consists of the matrices of RNA and protein unique molecular identifier (UMI) counts (Fig. 1a). Categorical covariates such as experimental batch or donor are optional inputs used for integrating datasets and referred to henceforth as “batch”."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "输入数据集可以有不同的抗体面板，并且其中一个子集可以是 scRNA-seq 数据集，即没有蛋白质。",
      "basis": "CAUTION_CONTEXT",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "quote": "Input datasets can have different antibody panels, and a subset can be scRNA-seq datasets (i.e., without proteins)."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "totalVI 的训练过程被适配为处理缺失蛋白质数据，蛋白质特征的缺失取决于批次索引。",
      "basis": "CAUTION_CONTEXT",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 2,
          "quote": "Here we adapted the training procedure from [65] to handle missing protein data. As any single batch may correspond to an experiment that used a different protein panel (or no proteins in the case of a scRNA-seq experiment), the missingness of protein features depends on the batch index sn."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "该缺失蛋白质处理假设所有批次共享同一组基因，并且观测数据的对数似然按批次分解。",
      "basis": "CAUTION_CONTEXT",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 2,
          "quote": "Further, suppose all batches share the same set of genes. Across all batches, there are T proteins. For cell n, we denote the observed protein expressions ynobs and the unobserved protein expressions ynmis. The log likelihood of the observed data decomposes as"
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "你提供的条件是一个 CITE-seq 批次加一个 scRNA-seq 批次，RNA 在两个批次都是 UMI 计数，蛋白质只在 scRNA-seq 批次缺失，这与上述缺失蛋白质处理框架在形式上一致。",
      "basis": "USER_PROVIDED_FACT",
      "citations": [],
      "context_fact_ids": [
        "user:batch_composition",
        "user:rna_modality",
        "user:protein_modality"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "但当前没有已批准的科学 KG 陈述直接确认 totalVI 对你的具体数据组合的适用性，因此不能据此断言该方法一定适配你的数据。",
      "basis": "MODEL_KNOWLEDGE",
      "citations": [],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "提醒：上述来源内容属于未断言的候选提醒，不代表已批准的科学断言，也不能作为执行许可；适用性仍需结合你的实际数据条件判断。",
      "basis": "CAUTION_CONTEXT",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "quote": "Input datasets can have different antibody panels, and a subset can be scRNA-seq datasets (i.e., without proteins)."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    }
  ],
  "clarification": {
    "question": "两个批次是否共享同一组基因，并且 scRNA-seq 批次是否确实完全没有蛋白质特征（而不是部分缺失）？",
    "missing_field": "shared_gene_set_and_protein_absence",
    "why_needed": "totalVI 的缺失蛋白质处理假设所有批次共享同一组基因；如果基因集不一致或 scRNA-seq 批次存在部分蛋白质特征，会影响模型适用性和输入构造方式。"
  }
}
